      ask: "{CLIENT}: All you've got is a paperclip? Then trade it up! {N} {TOKENS} with folk round {REGION} should do it.",
      lead: { name: 'THE MERCHANT', spr: 'merchant', lines: ["THE MERCHANT: A paperclip? Excellent start. My fortune began with a single bent nail.", "THE MERCHANT: Trade with everyone. Everyone wants something. The trick is finding out what."] },
